        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Didier Drogba, Habib Bamogo, Péguy Luyindula\n- Organizations: Olympique de Marseille, Chelsea, Phoenix Rising FC\n- Roles: striker\n- Topics: player transfers, team performance, goal scoring\n\nFacts:\n- Didier Yves Drogba Tébily was born on 11 March 1978.\n- Didier Drogba is an Ivorian professional footballer who plays as a striker for Phoenix Rising FC.\n- In the 2004–05 season, Olympique de Marseille sold striker Didier Drogba to Chelsea.\n- In the 2004–05 season, Olympique de Marseille replaced Didier Drogba with Habib Bamogo and Péguy Luyindula.\n- In the 2004–05 season, Habib Bamogo and Péguy Luyindula did not perform at a level similar to Didier Drogba for Olympique de Marseille.\n- In the 2004–05 season, Olympique de Marseille's goal scoring declined after Didier Drogba was sold.\n- In the 2004–05 season, Olympique de Marseille scored two fewer points than in the previous season.\n- In the 2004–05 season, Olympique de Marseille finished two positions higher than in the previous season.",
